{"id": "EUVD-2026-96567", "enisaUuid": "ea8bb001-3690-3b11-9283-83055cf6924f", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the saveDeptRolePermission endpoint of SysDepartPermissionController that allows any authenticated user to modify department role permissions. Low-privileged attackers can submit roleId and permissionIds values to grant arbitrary menu or button permissions, escalating privileges or revoking other users' permissions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T02:32:11", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_dept_role_policy_reads_and_save.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysDepartPermissionController.java#L252-L271", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-savedeptrolepermission-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108628", "GHSA-5xxx-327x-j7r9"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "538f8e1d-0189-37cb-80ac-c9aa950e31d8", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1393f177-161d-3b45-8fe2-1cbb09461018", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}